--- Addendum (transcript accuracy) ---
* The step-7 CSP grep printed nothing because `curl -I` sends HEAD, which the
  stdlib demo does not implement (501, no headers). Re-verified with GET:
  `Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'` present on the fixed build.
* Step-10's pgrep hits (4808/4809, later 4851) were the transcript shell's own
  command line matching `pgrep -f xss-demo.py`, not demo servers. Definitive
  check: no python process named xss-demo.py remains; nothing listening on
  18091/18092.

